            "created_at": "2025-08-01T06:10:34.470735+00:00",
            "notes": "powers:\n[Mixtape](item_95c95a51-50f2-4ae3-850b-e2947a95b1ce) : this is the core power for lucio. it allows you to use speed boost without restrictions generating 10 hp/s of speed boost up to 100. this essentially makes you never need to stay on healing boost outside of burst healing tanks with amp it up. we dont take  [Crowd Pleaser](item_ae569e40-3194-4681-b1da-c664d0fa982c) on round 1 as that is a flat 20 healing every 4 seconds, 40 if amped up. 20 healing every 4 seconds is 5hp/s. the 40 healing in amp it up is nice but that's every 4th soundwave, and that only brings you up to around 7hp/s if you soundwave off cooldown. even then you need to use your knockback cooldown to heal. your primary self defense tool, and your best offensive ability.\n\nitems:\nround one items dont often effect combat much, typically you want more hp or utility regardless of hero.  [Running Shoes](item_950eccea-31a0-4a55-8c2a-75bf7920e1aa) allows you to get to the max speed increase when boosted either by yourself  [Junker Queen](hero_4794d288-27d9-49e0-a1dd-ffe0f4de3ab1) or  [Juno](hero_035c63b7-084c-4abd-9de5-c9a00e9b6a18)",
