            "notes": "items:\n [#1 Single](item_5c5d5331-2966-440b-b989-aa92187eef97) this item allows you to break line of sight or extend away from teammates more safely. this allows you to play more aggressively, and allows you to save teammates without needing to break your aura with others. if you can afford it buy some  [Ability Power](stat_ability_power)  and [Cooldown Reduction](stat_cooldown_reduction) . i usually have enough for  [Multi-Tool](item_5ba8d94e-f2f3-44b7-8773-025fc6ed7c56) and a few greens. if you earn enough you can get  [Multi-Tool](item_5ba8d94e-f2f3-44b7-8773-025fc6ed7c56) and  [Nano Cola](item_79b22609-8046-4a8a-a5a2-bb49cd7e11c6) .",
