            "notes": "powers:\n [Reverb](item_c973a6d8-47ee-4846-adb4-78f40c1b6a9f) is preferred, especially if you are on a map with environmental opportunity. its essentially 100% increased knockback effectiveness\n [Megaphone](item_d995adf3-1789-4a16-b85c-21b8c14e4f7d) is good for those pesky  [Reaper](hero_0449752f-1c58-487b-b9a0-ca727d784457)  and  [Genji](hero_31fd201d-2f46-41e4-b125-9fa9e55fed46) players that never stay in your aura and keep dying alone blaming your healing despite the moira dpsing.\n\nitems:\n [All-Out Auditiva](item_7e33b7e7-4f7a-4f9f-bc25-39ce2a8f56b2) 25% longer amp it up means you can heal tanks more effectively, speed boost out of spawn farther, and just geneally keep your teams mobility up. if you can afford it again focus on boosting your  [Ability Power](stat_ability_power) and [Cooldown Reduction](stat_cooldown_reduction) with some blues and greens.",
